abstract: >-
  Public research and collaboration repository for African molecular biosciences,
  plant genetics, industrial hemp and Cannabis sativa science, mycology,
  fermentation and SCOBY systems, natural products, molecular diagnostics,
  and evidence-informed regulatory science.
